k to the smoothed track profile (the 30 m DSM includes tree canopy).","Road bumps and ruts in the drive are illustrative; the grade and the line of the track are real.","Trees, shrubs, grass tufts and boulders are placed where WorldCover maps that cover; their size and number are illustrative.","The walking loop is a 150 m circle around the arrival point; it is not a mapped trail.","The falls are drawn on the real slope at the stream foot; the foot is not levelled.","The rock face is drawn 60 m high and the ribbons hang on it. The height is ESTIMATED: the 30 m DEM shows the slope above the falls but cannot resolve the drop, and no published height was found.","The ribbons, their widths, the foam and the spray are illustrative; the boulders are placed by a fixed seed.","Season colours, snow, ice and dawn mist are illustrative.","Traffic on the drive is illustrative: the vehicle kinds are those seen on Swat roads (Willys jeeps, Hilux, Suzuki vans, Mehran cars, CD70 motorbikes, Qingqi rickshaws, painted trucks); their number and movement are not counted."],"sources":[{"name":"Copernicus DEM GLO-30","use":"terrain heights","licence":"© DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and © Airbus Defence and Space GmbH 2014-2018, provided under COPERNICUS by the European Union and ESA","url":"https://spacedata.copernicus.eu/collections/copernicus-digital-elevation-model"},{"name":"ESA WorldCover 10 m 2021 v200","use":"trees, meadow, rock, snow","licence":"CC BY 4.0, © ESA WorldCover project 2021","url":"https://esa-worldcover.org"},{"name":"OpenStreetMap waterfall node 3524615390","use":"the point of the falls (within about 0.2 m of the Atlas place point)","licence":"ODbL","url":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/3524615390"},{"name":"OpenStreetMap","use":"the Mahodand Lake jeep track (ways 507506230 and 345805207), the waterfall node, the stream and the ford where the stream crosses the road","licence":"ODbL, © OpenStreetMap contributors","url":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"}]}